### IncidentAgent API smoke test
### Run top to bottom in Rider (HTTP Client). Requires the API running in Development (seed data present).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@adminId = a9c4e8b3-1d7f-4a2c-b5e9-3c4d5e6f7a03
@priyaId = a9c4e8b3-1d7f-4a2c-b5e9-3c4d5e6f7a04
@categoryId = 3f1a7c52-9b1e-4d6a-8c3e-1a2b3c4d5e01
@serviceId = 7d2e9a10-4c5b-4f8a-9e6d-2b3c4d5e6f02
@otherServiceId = 7d2e9a10-4c5b-4f8a-9e6d-2b3c4d5e6f03

### Health (no DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (checks PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Hello
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello

### Reference data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

### 1. Create incident -> 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke test: checkout timeout",
  "description": "Checkout requests time out after 30 seconds.",
  "priority": "P2High",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "reporterId": "{{adminId}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("incidentId", response.body.id); %}

### 2. List with paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents?page=1&pageSize=5

### 3. List with filters + search (case-insensitive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents?status=Open&priority=P2High&serviceId={{serviceId}}&search=SMOKE

### 4. Get by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}

### 5. Update (priority + service change -> history rows)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke test: checkout timeout (updated)",
  "description": "Checkout requests time out after 30 seconds for card payments.",
  "priority": "P1Critical",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{otherServiceId}}",
  "actorUserId": "{{adminId}}"
}

### 6. Assign (Open -> Assigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": "{{priyaId}}", "actorUserId": "{{adminId}}" }

### 7. Valid status change: Assigned -> Investigating -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "Investigating", "actorUserId": "{{priyaId}}", "note": "Checking gateway logs" }

### 8. Invalid status change: Investigating -> Closed -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "Closed", "actorUserId": "{{priyaId}}" }

### 9. Add comment -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Gateway timeout raised from 30s to 60s as a mitigation.", "actorUserId": "{{priyaId}}" }

### 10. History (oldest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/history

### 11. Invalid body -> 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "P2High",
  "categoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "reporterId": "{{adminId}}"
}

### 12. Unknown id -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 13a. Concurrent create A (run 13a and 13b together; numbers must differ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke test: concurrent A",
  "description": "Concurrency check A.",
  "priority": "P4Low",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "reporterId": "{{adminId}}"
}

### 13b. Concurrent create B
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke test: concurrent B",
  "description": "Concurrency check B.",
  "priority": "P4Low",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "serviceId": "{{serviceId}}",
  "reporterId": "{{adminId}}"
}
